              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "The data set contains more than 52 thousands unique user-agent strings to numerous Internet browsing software. Each user-agent string is parsed into 47 elements. In addition, the relative exposure score of each browser is calculated based on the value of its user-agent string and corresponding vulnerabilities retrieved from the NVD database. Finally, the source code for exploring the data and the approach is fully provided (PHP)."
                },
